{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16112700","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16112700","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:1:1611268001:0":{"text":"Just as you're about to discuss your thoughts with Rowan, the crowd stirs.","source_cn":"你正想和罗万聊聊对大导师的看法，周围人群突然骚动起来","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF32039FEE610551","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Just as you're about to discuss your thoughts with Rowan, the crowd stirs.","female":"Just as you're about to discuss your thoughts with Rowan, the crowd stirs.","variant_male_record_index":"213344","variant_female_record_index":"213345","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1611268002:0":{"text":"Grand Mentor Esten steps up amid waves of applause.","source_cn":"随着一阵掌声，埃斯特大导师出场了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49213E91AC82E348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:5:1611269001:":{"text":"Everyone, please welcome Grand Mentor Esten!","source_cn":"请大家鼓掌欢迎埃斯特大导师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2EE2D37FF05ECF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:5:1611269002:":{"text":"Welcome, Grand Mentor!","source_cn":"欢迎埃斯特大导师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13A677FAB3B76E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:5:1611269003:":{"text":"&*##%!","source_cn":"**&*##%！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34C48A6B31DC6A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1611270001:1":{"text":"Dear students, put down your wands. Today, we don't need magic. We need open hearts and honest minds.","source_cn":"莱希拉姆的朋友们，请放下你们的法杖——今天，我们不需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1604063CF8E1D25C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1611270002:1":{"text":"I know some of you are doubtful... some hopeful... some anxious... and some afraid.","source_cn":"我知道，你们有人在怀疑，有人在期待，有人在焦虑，也有人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ECD881E9A6AC19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1611270003:1":{"text":"When your voices suddenly failed you, when all you could produce were strange, animal‑like sounds, you sought out healers. And the healers told you it was \"vocal strain\" or some kind of \"curse\", didn't they?","source_cn":"当你们发现自己突然无法正常讲话，只能发出动物般的怪音时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF309EF2F3A867044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1611270004:1":{"text":"No, this is not a curse, not a prank, and not a physical injury. It is your soul's fear of speaking.","source_cn":"不，亲爱的朋友们，这不是什么魔法诅咒或恶作剧，也不是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFADC4394E7415C39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1611270005:1":{"text":"You think those strange sounds mean you're sick? No. They are your emotional mana calling out for help.","source_cn":"你们以为自己发出的怪声是疾病？不，这是你们的“情绪魔力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD12BF693A80B1A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1611270006:1":{"text":"You've been treating the body, ignoring the \"Mana Triangle\"—where emotion, flesh, and power meet!","source_cn":"传统的治疗方法是药剂或手术，可却不知道真正的病因藏在“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE7B68814BBBE4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1611270007:1":{"text":"As I clearly wrote in The Codex of the Heart, \"The voice is emotional mana made manifest as vibration.\"","source_cn":"我在《心之魔典》中曾清楚地写过：“声音是情绪的具象化魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E4907B30264BB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1611270008:1":{"text":"When fear makes you clench your jaw, mana hardens in your throat. Your fear surges back into the language center of your mind and creates a blockage.","source_cn":"我曾多次通过实验证实：情绪能量的紊乱永远先于生理症状出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDFB994C4FCFF51B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1611270009:1":{"text":"Through repeated experiments, I've proven this: Emotional imbalance always appears before physical symptoms. You are not sick. Some painful memory is simply swallowing your voice.","source_cn":"来吧，我将邀请一位罹患“失语症”的朋友上台，将我的理论...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC662DDC39609896E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1611270010:1":{"text":"Now then. I'd like to invite one of our friends with the ailment to the stage, so I can turn theory into practice and show you the method myself. You there, in the first row, would you be willing to come up and assist?","source_cn":"让我看看……这位朋友，你愿意上台来配合治疗吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA005D91D384E6247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1611270011:0":{"text":"...#%?**&*##%?","source_cn":"……#%？**&*##%？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994AC457C4874004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1611270012:0":{"text":"He chooses a girl you vaguely remember Solise treating earlier. She looks surprised, but nods and walks up the stage.","source_cn":"埃斯特选中了前排的一位魔法学生，她有些惊讶，但最后还是...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC585B3010A6DF846","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He chooses a girl you vaguely remember Solise treating earlier. She looks surprised, but nods and walks up the stage.","female":"He chooses a girl you vaguely remember Solise treating earlier. She looks surprised, but nods and walks up the stage.","variant_male_record_index":"213360","variant_female_record_index":"213361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1611270013:0":{"text":"His speech gave you a headache. Everything feels like a scam, so you decide to remain cautious.","source_cn":"大导师上面那番理论让你感到头晕脑胀，听起来很有骗术的味...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9D24956DE71E2399","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"His speech gave you a headache. Everything feels like a scam, so you decide to remain cautious.","female":"His speech gave you a headache. Everything feels like a scam, so you decide to remain cautious.","variant_male_record_index":"213362","variant_female_record_index":"213363","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1611270014:1":{"text":"Good. Now, you must do exactly as I say.","source_cn":"很好，请你放下负担，放下怀疑，放下疑虑，全心全意相信我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC3EAE3FF87481C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1611270015:1":{"text":"Your complete trust is not a request. It is the foundation. A <style=\"highlight\">pact</style> between us. Do you understand?","source_cn":"记住，一定要全心全意地信任我，跟随我的引导完成每一个步...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93EF6A22C74FE1BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1611270016:1":{"text":"#%!","source_cn":"*#%！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4451169DC73D254","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1611270017:1":{"text":"Excellent. Then follow me.","source_cn":"好，那我们就说定了。现在，请跟随我的指引，做下面的动作——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B982A209CD6323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271001:":{"text":"Breathe in... and raise your hands.","source_cn":"深呼吸，抬起手","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8842ECFFEBD7BA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271002:":{"text":"Feel the fear that binds you.","source_cn":"恐惧束缚着你的声音","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D7BFEDDA8BCD37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271003:":{"text":"And now... break them!","source_cn":"挣脱它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35EAF341E31B2A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271004:":{"text":"Open your mouth. Let the sound out. \"Ah—\"","source_cn":"发出“啊——”的声音","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23999455EF3C5583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271005:":{"text":"##——","source_cn":"##——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E440449142675F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271006:":{"text":"Now! Your name! Shout it!","source_cn":"喊出你自己的名字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17DA30E30820787E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271007:":{"text":"&##*%!","source_cn":"*&*##*%！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC16E14E627F0279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271008:":{"text":"AGAIN!","source_cn":"大声点，再来一次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x799BC64BE10B61EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271009:":{"text":"&#......","source_cn":"*&*#……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D0CDCD0025F3C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271010:":{"text":"...E...Emily.","source_cn":"……艾……艾米丽","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E54A6AAF7B04A24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271011:":{"text":"I can talk!","source_cn":"我能说话了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B830F58CB15FE4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:27:1611271012:":{"text":"Congratulations, Emily! You freed your own voice!","source_cn":"恭喜你，艾米丽！你拯救了自己的声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C03EE9C403EAAF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:16011257:0":{"text":"The Grand Mentor cures Emily's speech loss with a strange \"treatment,\" leaving everyone stunned.","source_cn":"大导师使用奇特的“治疗方法”治好了艾米丽的失语症，众人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6009660CD9D89D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:16011256:0":{"text":"The Grand Mentor appears. The students and supporters who have been waiting for him break into applause.","source_cn":"大导师出现在大家面前，期待已久的学生和支持者们鼓掌欢迎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AFACCB384D536C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title"